<title>LATVIA: MISA PEAT 1996 PROFIT 28,460 LATS.</title>
<headline>MISA PEAT 1996 PROFIT 28,460 LATS.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Misas Kudra (Misa Peat) company made a net profit of 28,640 lats in 1996, the stock exchange said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>It gave no comparative figures in a statement of the company's 1996 earnings, which also showed a turnover of 460,474 lats and a gross profit of 115,483 lats.</p>
<p>The company's assets came to 332,767 lats at the end of last year, the bourse added.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
